# Can a sunset say goodbye? Turner's The Fighting Temeraire
tags: ["art history","turner","painting light","symbolism in art","romanticism","naval history"]
teaches: ["art-history/symbolism-in-painting","concepts/composition-and-meaning","methods/painting-light-to-convey-emotion","vocabulary/artistic-techniques"]
